THIRD-PARTY AND ADAPTED MATERIAL
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The EDIFY command-line tool has no runtime dependencies. It runs on the
Python standard library alone.

Optional, never required:
  tree-sitter                 MIT License
  tree-sitter-language-pack   MIT License
  Universal Ctags             GPL-2.0 (invoked as an external binary only;
                              never linked, never redistributed)

Skill library entries carry their own provenance and licence in frontmatter.
An entry marked `provenance: adapted` derives from upstream material and is
governed by the upstream licence recorded in that entry's `license:` field,
not by this project's LICENSE. `edify governance list` prints the licence of
every file EDIFY installs into a repository.

